<title>UK: London gold fixes fractionally firmer at $369.20.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes fractionally firmer at $369.20.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $369.20, up 20 cents on previous fixing. Very quiet so far with no direction overnight. Some guidance possible from Dow later. OTC option expiry unlikely to make waves.</p>
<p>SILVER - Marked up a cent behind gold to $4.87/$4.88. Virtually ignored so far.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Quiet and 50 cents firmer at $371.50/$372.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Unchanged at $118.00/$119.00.</p>
</text>
